Package: nswtheme
Title: Apply the NSW Government brand to data viz objects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Tyson", "Goddard", , "tyson.goddard@treasury.nsw.gov.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A set of scales (colour/fill, x, y) and themes for chart
    ('ggplot2') and table ('flextable') objects consistent with the 'NSW
    Government brand guidelines'
